|desc=
Brings the target's inner demons to the surface.  Each turn, for {{ctl|15|4|10}} turns, there's a chance that a demon will surface, requiring the target to make a Mental Save to keep it from manifesting. If the demon materializes, it will attack the target for 10 turns before disappearing.

The chance of a demon surfacing is {{cl|{{ctmd|15|30}}|100%|0|0|21%|21}}.

If the target is sleeping, the chance to save will be halved, and fear immunity will be ignored.  Otherwise, if the summoning is resisted, the effect will end early.

The summon chance will scale with your Mindpower and the demon's life will scale with the target's rank.

If a demon manifests the sheer terror will remove all sleep effects from the victim, but not the Inner Demons.

The demon is an exact copy of the target, except for the following attributes:
*Max life will be 50% of target's max life divided by the target's [[Rank]]
*All damage penalized by -50%
*Will never flee
*Cannot use {{t|Summon}} and {{t|Multiply}}
*Cannot use any talent that is prohibited for NPCs

You will gain full experience points for any kills made by the demon.
